Orbit 9

Install libgpu, TinyGL and raylib as described in boot/GPU.md. In rio:

    cd /sys/src/games/pinball
    mk install
    mk test
    games/pinball -a

See pinball(1) for rules and controls. To capture the demo:

    games/pinball -ad -n 900 -o /tmp/pinball.png

mk test runs the physics and game rules without a window. It exercises
individual shots and plays ten simulated minutes using the player controls.
Graphics and sound have been tested on amd64/QEMU with VirGL and HDA.
